Generate a site using only a completed snapshot

Usage: diplodocus generate [OPTIONS] --input <PATH>

Options:
      --allow-components  Emit executable browser bundles retained in this trusted snapshot
      --color <COLOR>     Control terminal colors in help, diagnostics, and status output [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --input <PATH>      Completed SQLite documentation snapshot
      --no-progress       Print stage summaries instead of animated progress bars
      --output <PATH>     Directory in which to write the generated site [default: ./site]
  -q, --quiet             Suppress routine status output while retaining warnings and errors
      --format <FORMAT>   Output complete site pages or embeddable HTML and Markdown fragments [default: site] [possible values: site, fragments]
      --url-map <PATH>    Public document and asset URL map (requires --format fragments)
  -h, --help              Print help
